ions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  the presence of a contraindication to the performance of conventional radiography (CR) or EOS imaging\n-  any disease affecting cognition\n-  Patients who have had surgery on the spine and / or hip.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- the presence of a contraindication to the performance of conventional radiography (CR)",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "conventional radiography",\n                "CR"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "conventional radiography",\n                "CR"\n              ],\n              "Contraindication": [\n                "contraindication"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or EOS imaging",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "EOS imaging"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "EOS imaging"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- any disease affecting cognition",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cognition",\n            "disease"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "cognition"\n          ],\n          "Stability": [\n            "affecting"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients who have had surgery on the spine",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "surgery"\n       